    "goal": "Implement and verify the complete native Parent consolidation designed in docs/specs/native-parent-delivery-consolidation.spec.md to finish #246. Preserve original settled S4 and retirement-repair records, give the final combined bytes fresh QA/Review under this task, and explicitly integrate both source runs plus this task itself through one native-confirmed, scope-bounded final delivery. Do not re-enroll settled sources, infer association from names, weaken dirty/path/identity checks, fabricate failed verification, modify Kernel core/store, publish or push. Ordinary batch/Lane/task routes stay unchanged. Supported inputs and negative cases are bounded by the Spec; existing source Intent/audit paths in scope are delivery inputs to preserve, not permission to rewrite them.",
