        "assertion": "Source E5 in bound Spec. Pi and Claude strictly parse and display the same explicit source-run/final-run/HEAD/tree contribution binding. Native acceptance permits only that effect; absent, declined or cancelled confirmation and a changed HEAD/digest after confirmation produce no unauthorized commit, final command or source association. Duplicate/self selections reject. Explicit recovery from commit-before-receipt interruption verifies the same commit and proof and does not duplicate Git effects.",
